            <span class="mt-2 block text-sm text-encre-soft">Usine, atelier, entrepôt</span>
            <span class="mt-4 inline-block border-b border-azur-600 pb-0.5 text-sm font-semibold text-azur-600">Démarrer l'étude →</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/devis/mon-toit?mode=commercial" class="v2-rise border-t-2 border-brass-400 bg-blanc p-6">
